Override for the corresponding `om node push asset` discovery probe, the
SMBIOS system uuid of the node, `/sys/class/dmi/id/product_uuid`.

A hypervisor sets it to the uuid of the virtual machine, so the collector
links a guest node to the container resource of its hypervisor running it.
Set it only when the probe finds none, or a wrong one.

Not to confuse with `node.uuid`, the collector authentication token.
